{"lines": ["How is Joseph Stalin connected to Steve from Minecraft?", "In nineteen fifty-three, Prime Minister Churchill greeted the new Queen, Elizabeth the Second, and her children.", "In twenty fourteen, the Queen made Angelina Jolie an honorary dame at Buckingham Palace.", "In two thousand eight, Jolie and Jack Black brought Kung Fu Panda to the Cannes Film Festival.", "And in twenty twenty-five, Jack Black became Steve in A Minecraft Movie.", "How is Joseph Stalin connected to Optimus Prime?", "In December nineteen forty-nine, Mao Zedong came to Moscow for Stalin's seventieth birthday.", "In nineteen seventy-five, President Gerald Ford flew to Beijing and met Mao, a year before Mao died.", "Ford and George H W Bush were old friends, and in nineteen seventy-six Ford made Bush director of the CIA.", "In nineteen eighty-nine, President Bush welcomed movie star Robert Redford to the Oval Office.", "In twenty twelve, Redford premiered his film The Company You Keep in Venice with co-star Shia LaBeouf.", "In twenty twenty-five, Shia LaBeouf, star of Transformers, reunited with Peter Cullen at Steel City Con.", "And Optimus Prime is voiced by Peter Cullen, who played him for over forty years.", "How is Saddam Hussein connected to Cookie Monster?", "In nineteen eighty-three, Saddam Hussein shook hands with Donald Rumsfeld, sent to Baghdad as Reagan's special envoy.", "In two thousand six, after leading the Pentagon through the Iraq War, Rumsfeld resigned as George W Bush's defense secretary.", "In two thousand eight, days after the election, Bush welcomed Barack and Michelle Obama to the White House.", "And in twenty eleven, Michelle Obama posed on stage with Cookie Monster at an event for military families in Ohio."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.2], ["is", 0.2, 0.38], ["Joseph", 0.38, 0.66], ["Stalin", 0.66, 1.2], ["connected", 1.2, 1.74], ["to", 1.74, 2.02], ["Steve", 2.02, 2.34], ["from", 2.34, 2.86], ["Minecraft?", 2.86, 3.12], ["In", 4.46, 4.54], ["1953,", 4.54, 5.04]